/*
File: SkullbonezData/generated/GeneratedShaderReflection.h
Purpose:
  Declares compile-time shader reflection tables baked from DXC containers.

Summary:
  Generated automatically by tools/bake_shaders.py from HLSL shader reflection
  blobs. Provides static tables of constant-buffer fields, resource bindings,
  and input layouts used by runtime shader binding validation.

Invariants:
  - Do not edit directly; regenerate with tools/bake_shaders.py.
  - Reflection data exactly mirrors the checked-in shipping shader bytecodes.

Related:
  - Agentic/Reference/engine-glossary.md
  - tools/bake_shaders.py
  - SkullbonezSource/Rendering/DX12/RenderBackendDX12.Pipeline.cpp
*/
